{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_5000_place", "source_sha256": "2d78dc2cad51c3aa4d3235e8b7ea5dd5fe43154a25e52424b92b09041772fa21", "ja": "オフィス", "zh": "办公室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_5001_p", "source_sha256": "075cc8ac058711d624b1d131596f3ec82f8b5a7ca49b9bc0b7535ac62fd8d167", "ja": "（今日はドラマの撮影だ。主演の貴音は、\n企業の悪を暴く、インターンの大学生役だが……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄电视剧。主演贵音饰演的是\n揭露企业黑幕的大学实习生，但……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_5002_008tak", "source_sha256": "def3e2ef5adf6245522565a7a4646b2941b9ce0322fcc3dc440ea5db005a8d54", "ja": "{$P$}、少々よろしいでしょうか。\nこの後の撮影について、相談があるのですが……。", "zh": "{$P$}，可以占用您一点时间吗？\n关于接下来的拍摄，我有件事想和您商量……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_5003_p", "source_sha256": "cc05c47349f52e74eb042c3d45f7117669edd9da2bf5c8ee317305dc134f372e", "ja": "ああ、どうした？", "zh": "啊，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_5004_008tak", "source_sha256": "ab5cb301f936a81185d99be56a6164935ba88ed2c887e56b95b57f934eaf846c", "ja": "私が扮する『すーぱーいんたーん』が、\n不正を行った部長を糾弾する場面なのですが……。", "zh": "我扮演的\"超级实习生\"，\n要揭发犯下不正行为的部长……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_5005_008tak", "source_sha256": "ce323194c5807800a9f86420c3e0f25fbb84e5cbc8b8469f360993fd24c2c908", "ja": "どのように演じるべきか、演技の方向性に\n悩んでいるのです。何かいい知恵はありませんか？", "zh": "我正在为该如何演绎、把握表演方向而苦恼。您有什么好主意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_5006_p", "source_sha256": "16d2219acb82b476931e950642bb0d242ff25edb4335e2ccfa25812a8af367cf", "ja": "ふむ、そういう事か……それなら……。", "zh": "嗯，原来是这么回事……那样的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_5007", "source_sha256": "d877f6988106049e76f868266e6825c3c3ba62fc4c2c94beb6055f375a969406", "ja": "大胆不敵に", "zh": "大胆无畏地", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_5008", "source_sha256": "992b3e11332b4e91fede66626dc28450e3d98cb95cf80b9455ab5e218194ddfd", "ja": "冷静沈着に", "zh": "冷静沉着地", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_5200_p", "source_sha256": "cfc35cd3ceb630a923edee9eb99ea4034e7b5f0adf7f3add4fe9b254089ff95e", "ja": "大胆不敵に演じるのはどうだ？　物怖じせず、\nスバッと切り込んでいった方が、かっこいいと思うぞ。", "zh": "演得大胆无畏一点怎么样？毫不畏缩、\n干脆利落地直接切入，我觉得这样会更帅气喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_5201_008tak", "source_sha256": "50e1d188fb48b13b8bcb8818ea8b6f93ef03c02513dbd1447c9562b3c7017221", "ja": "たしかにそうですね。たとえ不利な状況でも、\n果敢に立ち向かう姿は、見る者に勇気を与えるはず。", "zh": "确实如此。即使身处不利的局面，\n勇敢面对的身姿也一定能给观众带来勇气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_5202_008tak", "source_sha256": "216d0ebaaa004fd7565a7f2ec43e79f13d5f164f6ddcf60182001b10a4564543", "ja": "{$P$}の助言通り、\n全力で悪を討ってまいります。いざ……！", "zh": "正如{$P$}的建言，\n我定会全力讨伐邪恶。去也……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_5300_p", "source_sha256": "cfc35cd3ceb630a923edee9eb99ea4034e7b5f0adf7f3add4fe9b254089ff95e", "ja": "大胆不敵に演じるのはどうだ？　物怖じせず、\nスバッと切り込んでいった方が、かっこいいと思うぞ。", "zh": "演得大胆无畏一点怎么样？毫不畏缩、\n干脆利落地直接切入，我觉得这样会更帅气喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_5301_008tak", "source_sha256": "815183641ab1f1a64f31cdcff192a8b8e22b2c5222f038170d32a85387172bb5", "ja": "なるほど……。そのように演じれば、\nドラマも盛り上がるかもしれませんね。", "zh": "原来如此……如果那样来演，剧情或许也会更加精彩呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_5302_008tak", "source_sha256": "aaa4fc60ed830178abea1d5d69776631a35ebd641fda766cbe8f94f2962dd04b", "ja": "大げさに見えないか、少し不安ですが……\n私なりに、思い切りやってみようと思います。", "zh": "虽然有些担心会不会显得夸张……\n但我打算以自己的方式，放手一试。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_5500_p", "source_sha256": "cccf7e189605f279e2472bd6ce07c0c4916e6f86bab5546c79398a299a682393", "ja": "冷静沈着にいくのはどうだ？\n淡々と追い詰めた方が、かえって迫力があると思う。", "zh": "演得冷静沉着一点怎么样？\n我觉得淡定地步步紧逼，反而会更有魄力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_5501_008tak", "source_sha256": "b53a9146f5352f1bdce5661adf373d7ffd4a7e862363c8329e0ec92db72d24a7", "ja": "おや……私もそう思っていました。感情を\n表に出さない方が、凄味が出るのではないか、と。", "zh": "哦……我也是这么想的。与其把感情表露出来，不如收敛一些，或许更能显出气势。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_5502_008tak", "source_sha256": "ebb2653c2d9353bd781db9f587f6241d778d3d2178b7f089197b2848ec424205", "ja": "あなた様も同じことを考えていたとは……これで迷い\nなく、撮影に臨めそうです。ありがとうございます。", "zh": "没想到您也考虑到了同样的事……这样一来，我就能毫无疑虑地投入拍摄了。谢谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_5600_p", "source_sha256": "cccf7e189605f279e2472bd6ce07c0c4916e6f86bab5546c79398a299a682393", "ja": "冷静沈着にいくのはどうだ？\n淡々と追い詰めた方が、かえって迫力があると思う。", "zh": "演得冷静沉着一点怎么样？\n我觉得淡定地步步紧逼，反而会更有魄力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_5601_008tak", "source_sha256": "36240bf6da2b4426e5385c76707aecb2e3766c6346c307fbedd11038eb2fc634", "ja": "そうですね……。冷静でありながらも、\n熱い闘志を抱き、悪に挑む……。", "zh": "是啊……保持冷静的同时，\n怀抱炽热的斗志，向邪恶发起挑战……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_5602_008tak", "source_sha256": "ce0baabf7b73a78ca7f0f4a3b53c806c062717cbbee2afaef277b5d855cce3bb", "ja": "高い演技力が求められると思いますが……\nそれもまた、腕の見せ所ですね。頑張ってみます。", "zh": "我想，这需要很高的演技……\n不过，这也是展现本领的机会呢。我会努力试试的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
